    <string name="user_data_policy">Lo hlelo alukusiza iqedo yedata yomsebenzisi</string>
    <string name="setup_desc">Ngaphambi kokuthuthukela phambili, kunconywa ukwenza
        izinyathelo ezidingekayo ukuze uqinisekise ukuthi zonke izici
        zokusebenza zisebenza.</string>
    <string name="discord_setup_title">Ngaphambi kokuba qale</string>
    <string name="discord_setup_desc">Uqinisekise ukuthi i-Discord ivumela umsebenzi wakho ukubonakala ku-prophile yakho.</string>
    <string name="discord_step1_title">Isinyathelo 1: Vula izilungiselelo zokubucwaningi</string>
    <string name="discord_step1_content">Vula i-app ye-Discord → cindisha isithombe sakho ("Wena") → cindisha Izilungiselelo (⚙️) → skroliya phansi bese ucindisha "Umsayezo kanye Nezokuxhumana" (noma "Ubucwaningi bemsebenzi" emVERSIONS ezindala).</string>
    <string name="discord_step2_title">Isinyathelo 2: Vula ukwabelana nomsebenzi</string>
    <string name="discord_step2_content">Thola "Ukwabelana nomsebenzi wami" bese uyakuvula. Ngaphansi kwe"Ukuthi ngabelana nomsebenzi nini", khetha "Ukwabelana emisebenzini yonke". Skroliya ku-"Izinsiza zami" bese uvula izinsiza ofuna ukuthi isimo sakho sibonakale.</string>
    <string name="discord_step3_title">Isinyathelo 3: Bheka isimo sakho se-inthanethi</string>
    <string name="discord_step3_content">Cindisha isimo lakho (ngaphansi kwegama lakho) bese ukhetha Ku-inthanethi, Akukho okwenzakayo noma Ungomi. ⚠️ Ungasebenzisi Ukuxhweka — Discord ifihla umsebenzi wa Kizzy uma unguxhweka.</string>
    <string name="discord_tip_title">Uthola "Ukwabelana nomsebenzi wami"?</string>
    <string name="discord_tip_content">Ezinye izinguqulo zemobha ze-Discord zifihla lo switch. Vula i-discord.com ku-Chrome → nika i-sitesi ye-Desktop → ngena ngemilayezo → Izilungiselelo (⚙️) → Ubucwaningi bemsebenzi → vula "Ukwabelana nomsebenzi wami".</string>
